<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97708" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-σκευάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help in establishing</i> or <i>organizing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.93
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				8.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνθ᾽ ὁπόσα τὸν ἀνθρώπινον
				βίον ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				274d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				3.6
			</span></i>, etc.; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημιουργοὶ] τὸν βίον ἡμῖν ς. τέχναις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					920e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπιτήδειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Vect.</u>
					4.38
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὸν ἐν Ἀμφίσσῃ πόλεμον</span>
			<i>join in promoting</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.143
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα ς. τινί</span>
			<i>assist</i> him <i>in promoting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.17
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				17.15
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				55.43
			</span></i> (Odessus, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, Phld <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.25
			</span></i> O.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αζόμενος στοχασμός</span>,
			of mutually confirmatory or cumulative evidence, Hermog <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stat.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, cf. Arg.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.566
			</span></i>.</div>
